1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,846
There's a tuft of wool stuffed in my bedroom keyhole.

2
00:00:03,896 --> 00:00:06,001
It's been there for six years.

3
00:00:06,071 --> 00:00:09,034
My gran said the mare comes in through keyholes.

4
00:00:09,084 --> 00:00:13,015
She's the weight on your chest when you wake up and can't move.

5
00:00:13,085 --> 00:00:14,965
Block the hole while she's inside...

6
00:00:15,015 --> 00:00:16,605
and she can't leave.

7
00:00:16,995 --> 00:00:17,990
Six years ago,

8
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,568
she came every night.

9
00:00:19,618 --> 00:00:20,453
So one night,

10
00:00:20,503 --> 00:00:22,560
I stuffed the keyhole shut.

11
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:23,370
It stopped.

12
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,490
That same week,

13
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,840
I met my wife.

14
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,250
Tonight,

15
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,767
she asked what the wool was for.

16
00:00:28,817 --> 00:00:30,855
So I pulled it out to show her.

17
00:00:30,925 --> 00:00:32,701
She went very quiet.

18
00:00:33,011 --> 00:00:34,226
Three a.m.

19
00:00:34,276 --> 00:00:35,565
I couldn't move.

20
00:00:35,615 --> 00:00:38,196
Something was climbing onto my chest.

21
00:00:38,266 --> 00:00:40,151
I tried to reach for my wife.

22
00:00:40,201 --> 00:00:41,911
Her side of the bed was empty.

23
00:00:41,961 --> 00:00:43,320
Still warm.

24
00:00:43,549 --> 00:00:45,403
I never got rid of the mare.

25
00:00:45,453 --> 00:00:46,628
I married her.

26
00:00:47,258 --> 00:00:49,578
Long hair fell across my face.

27
00:00:49,808 --> 00:00:51,268
You let me out.
